    "methods_description": "EEG data were acquired using a Geodesic Net Amps 300 system with 128-channel Geodesic Hydrocell Sensor Net at 250 Hz sampling rate running Netstation 4.5.2 software. Stimuli were presented using E-Prime software (Version 2) in a delayed-verification math task paradigm. Participant characteristics including age, gender, body mass index (BMI), and task performance were recorded.",
